ement to resemble a link, use a button and change it with appropriate styles. Learn more: https://github.com/jsx-eslint/eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y/blob/HEAD/docs/rules/anchor-is-valid.md","'adAdmin' is defined but never used.","'adMain' is defined but never used.","'adSidebar' is defined but never used.",["351"],"'data' is defined but never used.","'have4Learn' is assigned a value but never used.","Assignments to the 'searchId' variable from inside React Hook useEffect will be lost after each render. To preserve the value over time, store it in a useRef Hook and keep the mutable value in the '.current' property. Otherwise, you can move this variable directly inside useEffect.","CallExpression","Assignments to the 'limit4Learn' variable from inside React Hook useEffect will be lost after each render. To preserve the value over time, store it in a useRef Hook and keep the mutable value in the '.current' property. Otherwise, you can move this variable directly inside useEffect.","jsx-a11y/no-redundant-roles","The element button has an implicit role of button. Defining this explicitly is redundant and should be avoided.","no-useless-concat","Unexpected string concatenation of literals.","unexpectedConcat","'keys' is assigned a value but never used.",{"desc":"352","fix":"353"},{"desc":"354","fix":"355"},{"desc":"356","fix":"357"},{"desc":"356","fix":"358"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [authToken, projects]",{"range":"359","text":"360"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [authToken, settingStore.value.theme]",{"range":"361","text":"362"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [authToken, callConfirmSetting, firstOpenSearch, id.word, location, navigate]",{"range":"363","text":"364"},{"range":"365","text":"364"},[6279,6290],"[authToken, projects]",[2100,2111],"[authToken, settingStore.value.theme]",[20117,20138],"[authToken, callConfirmSetting, firstOpenSearch, id.word, location, navigate]",[19546,19567]]